    why: "run #3 carried no data-status at this seam and was archived afterwards, in 40ff32c (W6 step 5, the round that found the one red doc nobody had archived). It stayed archived through every later commit until W12 swept it out of the tree. The seam reports the state as it was, which is true; the close happened, later."
