  - seam: 8173f4721f
    why: "cr/v3 did not exist when W2 merged. The schema was introduced at W7 in 4517354, whose own message names it 'the grandfather rule'. The grandfather clause covers a cr/v2 note that predates a FIELD; this tip carries no cr note at all, so the clause cannot reach it and the walk reports the absence. W2's work is not unreviewed - it went through three recorded review rounds - but the evidence predates the note contract that would carry it."
  - seam: 8173f4721f
